+| Mention (optional) | `DISCORD_MENTION_ID` → `config('services.discord.mention_id')`. A Discord user ID (17-20 digits); every alert then ends with `<@id>` on its own line to push-notify that user. Empty or invalid values (e.g. `@everyone`) are silently ignored. The mention counts toward the 1800-character limit; long alerts are truncated before it, never after |
